NOTES: Build planes as THREE.LineSegments grid + outline (no fill) so markers above remain readable; render marker glyphs and all text as sprite-based CanvasTexture labels that always face the camera, so the diagram stays legible while orbiting. Use dashed materials with computeLineDistances() for all trajectory chains; keep one Line per concept per branch (a single 5-point polyline) so hover highlight is a single material opacity/color swap. Hover picking should use invisible enlarged sphere pick-proxies at each marker/label anchor rather than raycasting sprites. layerStep dims all planes above the current level to ~15% opacity and fades their markers/labels out; 'joint space' state reveals the two black arrows and pulses the orange disk. branchView fades a whole branch group (planes, arrows, block boxes, markers, encoder rule) to 8% opacity rather than removing it, so the frame does not reflow. Depth-sort transparent sprites and disable depthWrite on faded groups to avoid z-fighting between stacked planes.

