/* ---------------- element spec ----------------------------------------------
 * embedding plane    → 4 thin CylinderGeometry edges (#4a4a4a) + LineSegments 4x4 grid (#dcdcdc), flat square in XZ
 * image marker       → Sprite w/ CanvasTexture glyph (circle / square / triangle) in concept colour, 0.36u
 * text item          → HTML addLabel ("blue triangle"), 11px sans-serif, anchored on the right planes
 * trajectory         → THREE.Line + LineDashedMaterial (concept colour left, #555 right), 5 pts, computeLineDistances
 * encoder arrow      → Group: CylinderGeometry shaft + ConeGeometry head, black
